{"unit_id": "DaYePython__dsh-input-optimize#feature-1", "repo": "DaYePython/dsh-input-optimize", "commit": "0ebe3336a554ef8960bff51c64adb985bb95014b", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-input-optimize 的功能「用当前模型优化草稿」：点击输入栏按钮后，将草稿提交给当前选中模型改写，并把有效结果写回输入框；模型选择不完整时尝试使用当前 Agent 的模型。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client/client.js:617", "lib/index.js:87", "lib/index.js:206"]}
{"unit_id": "DaYePython__dsh-input-optimize#feature-2", "repo": "DaYePython/dsh-input-optimize", "commit": "0ebe3336a554ef8960bff51c64adb985bb95014b", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-input-optimize 的功能「保留引用并处理附件」：优化前把引用 chip 替换为有序占位符，并传递附件名称；收到结果后校验占位符并恢复引用，附件清单会作为提示词上下文。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client/client.js:184", "client/client.js:221", "lib/prompt.js:91"]}
{"unit_id": "DaYePython__dsh-input-optimize#caveat-1", "repo": "DaYePython/dsh-input-optimize", "commit": "0ebe3336a554ef8960bff51c64adb985bb95014b", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-input-optimize 使用前须知：优化时，草稿提示词文本和附件名称会随请求交给 DSH 当前配置的模型；代码传递附件名称，不传附件字节。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client/client.js:603", "client/client.js:781", "lib/index.js:193"]}
